
1. Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/Internal-Company-Portal.git
cd Internal-Company-Portal


2. Create PostgreSQL database

CREATE DATABASE triobyte_portal1;


3. Backend setup

cd backend
npm install

Create backend/.env:

PORT=8000
DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:YOUR_POSTGRES_PASSWORD@localhost:5432/triobyte_portal1
JWT_SECRET=your_long_random_secret


4. Initialize database

npm run init-db


5. Load demo data

npm run seed


6. Start backend

npm run dev

Backend:
http://localhost:8000


7. Open a NEW terminal

cd Internal-Company-Portal/frontend
npm install
npm run dev


8. Open the frontend URL shown by Vite.

Usually:
http://localhost:5173


